(Speaking)\" width=\"270\" height=\"267\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"va\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Voice / Actor</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0\"><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm11619897\">Mara Allen</a></li></ul></div>\n</div></aside>\n<b>Herald of Balthazar</b> is a skull which warns those who enter the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Mausoleum\" title=\"Grand Mausoleum\">Grand Mausoleum</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Herald of Balthazar is an environmental object that can be interacted with. After its initial warning, if interacted with further, it repeats messages admonishing the party to leave the mausoleum.\n</p><p>Upon entering the mausoleum:\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\">Z'rell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> - Whoever you are, leave. I shall carry out <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">General Thorm's</a> will alone.\"</i></li></ul>\n<p>Interacting with it:\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"All is at hand. Your presence is not required.\"</i></li>\n<li><i>\"Not wanted. Not needed. Leave.\"</i></li>\n<li><i>\"This place is not for you. Go no farther.\"</i></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715002218\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31074/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14307/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/200\nExpensive parser function 